<div class="content-box" style="background: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;">
    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Watch Out For</h2>
    <p>Common misconceptions to avoid:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Linked List Pointers: Forgetting to update the "Tail" or "Prev" pointers during deletion, leading to memory leaks or broken chains.</li>
        <li>Hashing: Believing a "perfect" hash function eliminates the need for collision handling.</li>
    </ul>
